  "story": {
    "day": 89,
    "title": "Kaya's Big Mall Adventure",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was excited this afternoon to open and visit the mall.",
      "First, they took the bus along one straight block from home.",
      "Dad had a problem because he needed a computer to use.",
      "On the second floor, an office worker had a great fifty percent off deal.",
      "He paid eighty-nine cents, and they had change.",
      "Kaya wanted a beautiful skirt, shorts, jeans, a shoe, and a sock.",
      "Then, on the third floor, she saw a witch and a trumpet.",
      "Next, they turned a corner to a place called \"Hong Kong Island.\"",
      "It showed religious Hindu battle customs from the beach.",
      "Kaya didn't touch most of the other special plates and towels.",
      "\"Pardon, Dad, for the thirteenth, fourteenth, and sixteenth items?\"",
      "\"Okay,\" he said. \"Fortieth orange, radish soup, and thirteen delicious candy for two.\""
    ]
  }
